  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Tool Manipulation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls when using an imbued tool for each CE spent.</p>\n<p>As a reaction, you can cause one of your imbued tools to protect you. It grants you a bonus to AC or reduces damage depending on its size. If the tool has a bonus to AC or damage rolls, it is included in the AC and reduction respectively.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Size</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">AC</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Reduction</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Tiny</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">+1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">1d4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Small</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">+2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2d4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Medium</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">+3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2d6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Large</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">+4</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2d8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Huge</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">+5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2d10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
